OL,3,GNEWSAFormer nightclub site earmarked
OL,4,Afor 164 flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for more than 160 flats on the
OL,7,Fsite of a former nightclub in Hull are
OL,8,Fexpected to be approved next week.
OL,10,FThe application includes 164 flats and
OL,11,Ffour commercial units on land
OL,12,Fpreviously occupied by Circus Circus,
OL,13,Fwhich has been derelict for more than
OL,14,F20 years.
OL,16,FThe plans feature five studio flats,
OL,17,F138 one-bedroom, 16 two-bedroom, and
OL,18,Ffive three-bed apartments, with
OL,19,Fpotential discounts for first-time
OL,20,Fbuyers and key workers.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
